  "instructions": [
    "Bring the fish broth to a boil in a large pot.",
    "Add the fideo noodles and cook until al dente.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and saute until fragrant.",
    "Add the shrimp and mussels to the skillet and cook until the seafood is opaque and the mussels are open.",
    "Add the white wine to the skillet and stir to deglaze.",
    "Combine the cooked noodles, seafood mixture, and chopped parsley in a large serving dish.",
    "Toss to combine and serve immediately."
